# The API image builds from the repo root so it can see packages/. BuildKit picks
# this file up because it sits next to the dockerfile. Allowlist only what the
# build needs; everything else (web, node_modules, .git, .venv) stays out.
*
!Directory.Build.props
!apps/TakeInitiative.Api/
!packages/TakeInitiative.Dice/

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
